        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"00412e61-69d8-46d2-9a69-f2a02f48c330\",\"review_text\":\"Its...\"},{\"review_id\":\"2e12366b-f66d-4ad9-813b-f5641e8c8423\",\"review_text\":\"Great music ap\"},{\"review_id\":\"a679f5e1-ea51-4889-b6bf-aa641c8bcbaa\",\"review_text\":\"beautiful sound\"},{\"review_id\":\"c073e008-6620-4b24-ae8e-bf7095b352ef\",\"review_text\":\"So the app is great and you can play music when the app or phone is closed but the only problem is that it is kind of confusing\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ec5a453-eefb-46d9-876d-79eeac37a13c\",\"review_text\":\"Good.. I can listen to my favorite music really easy.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5da097e5-5253-4c03-a433-10c3bf2c2c3f\",\"review_text\":\"Good app to listen to all your favorite songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"b3e0905b-5baf-45f4-abad-9c9847536614\",\"review_text\":\"Terrific 🤮\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba4a08d1-5561-4cec-a4bc-81d9f01ad082\",\"review_text\":\"The best music all day\"},{\"review_id\":\"11b4f48b-f0f1-4396-abbe-29601fef826a\",\"review_text\":\"PERFECT MUSIC APP! By far the best one! Only bad thing is when I search \\ncertain artist they dont appear! Like kpop band DIA for example they're \\nthere but I can't find them :( pls fix this issue! Also on ps4 there isn't \\nan option to get 3 free months after paying like on mobile Spotify app! Can \\nyou please fix this issue? I would like my 3 free months but I cant get it \\nsince I pay using psn.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba8c113f-8820-4a5c-8995-5dedcbdaa37b\",\"review_text\":\"bh\"}]}"
